{"screen_name": "Halcyon_utaitai", "file": "Halcyon_utaitai", "name": "西村ぬ", "avatar_url": "https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/?d=identicon", "header_url": null, "description": "裏▶️@mofmofonmof", "total_works": 10, "scraped_works": 10, "first_seen": "2026-03-20T09:03:02.973236+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-03-20T09:03:02.973236+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 3000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-20T09:03:02.973236+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 3000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 3000, "max": 3000}}, "links": [], "flags": {}, "acceptable": false, "works": [{"path": "/@Halcyon_utaitai/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/55c92cb0/uploads/origins/261d4040-7c3e-44d0-b466-0093f14e6620?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=915eb4d3d645c5cf2a5a309317360972", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/55c92cb0/uploads/origins/261d4040-7c3e-44d0-b466-0093f14e6620?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=915eb4d3d645c5cf2a5a309317360972, https://si.imgix.net/55c92cb0/uploads/origins/261d4040-7c3e-44d0-b466-0093f14e6620?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f18a5a6f89f082a1ffbdd4c25fb02273 2x, https://si.imgix.net/55c92cb0/uploads/origins/261d4040-7c3e-44d0-b466-0093f14e6620?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7a56a05f693b18e8e738f0e399970eb3 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "I need a mob character for Summoner King Lex, Rimel Lena please!\nhttps://twitter.com/i/events/1030363844491673600?s=20\nhttps://twitter.com/tomoe_Q/status/1512701987862859780\nhttps://twitter.com/vampire_berry/status/1144026051753861120?s=20&t=L-gDyoevMail0P8fqLb2Eg\n\nHere's the scene from the original: https://twitter.com/adoringtamanegi/status/1477520131115065344?s=20&t=L-gDyoevMail0P8fqLb2Eg\n\nThere are various types of coloring, as for a long time the only coloring available was the black and white one from the comic book.\nWe will leave it up to you to decide which one you would like to use.\n\nWe would like the scene to be the original scene where she is being rescued and treated, but a normal standing picture would also be fine.\n\nThank you in advance!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Halcyon_utaitai/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8468b168/uploads/origins/13d28c94-1162-4861-92a1-1494bcf7fd43?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7d006008f567e6a5e4af07593b3b1071", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8468b168/uploads/origins/13d28c94-1162-4861-92a1-1494bcf7fd43?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7d006008f567e6a5e4af07593b3b1071, https://si.imgix.net/8468b168/uploads/origins/13d28c94-1162-4861-92a1-1494bcf7fd43?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7f361bf35ca8dbf6e434a9bb2cac513e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8468b168/uploads/origins/13d28c94-1162-4861-92a1-1494bcf7fd43?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6c57b30f4ebcb74e8bba45ae0e42712e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "もし気が向けばでよろしいのですが、過去に納品いただきました感じの配置で、温泉むすめの箱根彩耶さんと駅メモの七耀みつるさんを次のコスチュームでお願いします！\n・二人ともバニー衣装(長手袋あり・手袋なし)\n・二人とも忍者装束(彩耶さんは伊豆箱根バスの彩耶さんに手甲を追加、みつるさんはお任せしますが手甲は付けてください！）\n・片方はバニー、もう片方は忍者装束\nの各種パターンをお願いしたいと思います…！\n\n納品頂いたものは、今私がTwitterでサムネにしているものも含め、サムネに使用したいと考えております…！(気分によって着替えさせる感じです。)\nしたがいまして新規でも、過去作品の差分作成という形でも全然構いません…！\n\nURLは過去依頼いたしました作品ページと、忍者衣装の彩耶さんのページと、付けて頂きたい手甲です(色は問いません…！)。\n\nhttps://skeb.jp/@Halcyon_utaitai/works/3?s=09\nhttps://onsen-musume.jp/news/97675\n\nhttps://www.amazon.co.jp/dp/B001DDSJ7Y/ref=cm_sw_r_apan_glt_i_A7G049MET2JN95C5MZKA", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Halcyon_utaitai/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/16594ef6/uploads/origins/fb0df8de-13bb-43f9-a030-7454c9b0bc3f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=60635826e969ca3262a1cac423a3a3ec", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/16594ef6/uploads/origins/fb0df8de-13bb-43f9-a030-7454c9b0bc3f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=60635826e969ca3262a1cac423a3a3ec, https://si.imgix.net/16594ef6/uploads/origins/fb0df8de-13bb-43f9-a030-7454c9b0bc3f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=88b15d65f96aa38a954051f4932b6075 2x, https://si.imgix.net/16594ef6/uploads/origins/fb0df8de-13bb-43f9-a030-7454c9b0bc3f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ebae4308838f5e774ce612ce5e27e82c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "It's nice to meet you at Skeb.\nThis time, I'd like to ask you to draw an illustration of a two-shot of the onsen musume Dai-boss Sukunahiko-sama and the stray onsen musume, Mashuko-san of Kawayu Onsen.\n(About Mashuko-san: )\nhttps://twitter.com/teshikaga_tv/status/1309250486499860480 )\n\nSukunahiko-sama, who came to Lake Mashu on a private trip, chatted with Mashuko-san, an old acquaintance (or is it a god?). I would like to have a situation where Sukunahiko is enjoying chatting with Mashuko-san, who is an old acquaintance (Chigami?).\n\nI'd like to use the finished product as an icon or header, so please give me permission to use it as well.\n\nSo, I'd be happy if you could draw it when you have time.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Halcyon_utaitai/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/55862e99/uploads/origins/8fe13cb8-2e2b-47f5-ae42-5430ee096fe1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=40672ed6de390058db57d3cd93424939", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/55862e99/uploads/origins/8fe13cb8-2e2b-47f5-ae42-5430ee096fe1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=40672ed6de390058db57d3cd93424939, https://si.imgix.net/55862e99/uploads/origins/8fe13cb8-2e2b-47f5-ae42-5430ee096fe1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ce0eae673d26be7f34d2edbac13ef6c4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/55862e99/uploads/origins/8fe13cb8-2e2b-47f5-ae42-5430ee096fe1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2160a502097f9a76880c05c10e4d360f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Nice to meet you!\nI'd love to have Shiobara Yaya as my onsen musume (the miniature yukata costume version of the panel you can see at Yumori Tanakaya)!\nhttp://www.siobara.or.jp/shiobara88/place.htm\nI would like her to be in a situation where she is taking a break after getting out of the hot spring and is about to drink coffee milk after bathing or relaxing in her room at the ryokan (you can change it if you want).", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Halcyon_utaitai/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7af8dc81/uploads/origins/b87c0adc-e01f-443f-9999-ca56574709d8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=438087a118e8aeeda22ffd693acbf31f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7af8dc81/uploads/origins/b87c0adc-e01f-443f-9999-ca56574709d8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=438087a118e8aeeda22ffd693acbf31f, https://si.imgix.net/7af8dc81/uploads/origins/b87c0adc-e01f-443f-9999-ca56574709d8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=38ecc9a1440d4253f7b473a13a9c0647 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7af8dc81/uploads/origins/b87c0adc-e01f-443f-9999-ca56574709d8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8331405c47d4671f35fc6bed1ba7e179 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "よろしければ、温泉むすめの有馬輪花ちゃんと有馬楓花ちゃんのバニーコスチュームのイラストをお願いします！\nポーズ、バニー服の色等は、ヌ王さんにお任せします！有馬姉妹に合った色にしていただけば！\nただ、一般的なバニーコスに追加で手袋は着けてほしいです…！\n\n余力があれば手袋無し差分もお願いします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Halcyon_utaitai/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4bf4456a/uploads/origins/5ee5c09c-46dd-4aa1-b42d-ba52d10a5b6f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fcff9d2b6007ffe64ba65b73440df167", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4bf4456a/uploads/origins/5ee5c09c-46dd-4aa1-b42d-ba52d10a5b6f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fcff9d2b6007ffe64ba65b73440df167, https://si.imgix.net/4bf4456a/uploads/origins/5ee5c09c-46dd-4aa1-b42d-ba52d10a5b6f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=75eee9c9f148c7e4db5cd97aa71388f8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4bf4456a/uploads/origins/5ee5c09c-46dd-4aa1-b42d-ba52d10a5b6f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=952d32c59ec6725e91d6e9acbfd94a36 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "I'd like to see Misae parading around the hot spring town at night wearing an arrow patterned hakama.\nThe color of the hakama and the arrow pattern is up to you.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Halcyon_utaitai/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4c4d6f09/uploads/origins/6d2a6cbc-a871-409f-b284-b4b089730848?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7509ec4aae01427013d32ee985183a3c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4c4d6f09/uploads/origins/6d2a6cbc-a871-409f-b284-b4b089730848?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7509ec4aae01427013d32ee985183a3c, https://si.imgix.net/4c4d6f09/uploads/origins/6d2a6cbc-a871-409f-b284-b4b089730848?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f69a9c6e2ac913212c676030f621cfb4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4c4d6f09/uploads/origins/6d2a6cbc-a871-409f-b284-b4b089730848?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bc2ca5bdfef11c533901496c04ce517a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Nice to meet you. I'd like to make a similar request to the previous one.\nThe characters I would like to request are Sunawa Yubara from Onsen Musume and Celia Hoyo from Ekimemo.\nWe both have medical knowledge, and our personalities and proportions are similar.\nAs for the situation, I'd like the two of them to be talking in the sand bath.\nPlease remove Celia's pantograph.\n\nIf you can accept it, please do so.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Halcyon_utaitai/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1e38c552/uploads/origins/d0c0d0da-1c6e-4a9a-9eb5-9141eb09627a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9a9f6b5e306175e1856695f1e0251992", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1e38c552/uploads/origins/d0c0d0da-1c6e-4a9a-9eb5-9141eb09627a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9a9f6b5e306175e1856695f1e0251992, https://si.imgix.net/1e38c552/uploads/origins/d0c0d0da-1c6e-4a9a-9eb5-9141eb09627a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4c37456ec7d606f374b3294047a5372d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1e38c552/uploads/origins/d0c0d0da-1c6e-4a9a-9eb5-9141eb09627a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4e9670b79c9de9f599b33f875400407c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "もし時間がございましたら、温泉むすめの”箱根彩耶”さんと駅メモの”七耀みつる”さんを一緒に描いていただきたいです！\nシチュエーション…というよりポーズは下記のような感じでお願いします！背景は特に指定はしません！\n\n『二人共自分自身の腕を組んで正面に。それから互いの二の腕と背中の一部(脇腹と言ったほうが近いかも知れません)を接触させて、互いにごく若干身体を預けているような感じ』\nにお願いします。\n\n両キャラが相棒同士みたいな感じの雰囲気が出ていれば上記にポーズにとらわれなくても全然構いません！\n左右にどちらのキャラクターが来ても良いです。\n書きやすい方でお願いします！\n\n…余力があれば強キャラ感を出してください！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Halcyon_utaitai/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9859212a/uploads/origins/1b7b9fec-b78f-47a5-b3f2-d94c2d1815dd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fb42f33657dbfdfaf7934cce485ef3d4", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9859212a/uploads/origins/1b7b9fec-b78f-47a5-b3f2-d94c2d1815dd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fb42f33657dbfdfaf7934cce485ef3d4, https://si.imgix.net/9859212a/uploads/origins/1b7b9fec-b78f-47a5-b3f2-d94c2d1815dd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c49580da27157e4cf0fcd4b4cd9865ad 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9859212a/uploads/origins/1b7b9fec-b78f-47a5-b3f2-d94c2d1815dd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d6fca748b4d8526b4c349e31c79452f7 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "宜しければ、温泉むすめの”箱根彩耶”さんと駅メモの”天下さや”さんの二人を一緒に書いてください！\nポーズや背景等々、構想はお任せします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Halcyon_utaitai/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/afc013cc/requests/250077_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=687318318496e9f8a174e753f5d06d6c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/afc013cc/requests/250077_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=687318318496e9f8a174e753f5d06d6c, https://si.imgix.net/afc013cc/requests/250077_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c7af5865cef644400f4e0cff386bd0b4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/afc013cc/requests/250077_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9f2f489b74c7a897106d797530831874 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "I would like to ask you to make an illustration of a hot spring musume \"Onogawa Komachi\". I'll leave it to you to choose the clothes and pose. Please draw it as you like.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}